abeled 'pop' extends from the top of the stack to a light gray dashed box c=
ontaining the text ''[' is closed by ']':', illustrating that the top eleme=
nt '[' is being popped from the stack, implying a matching closing bracket =
']' is expected in the input stream to maintain balanced parentheses.  The =
diagram demonstrates how a stack is used to verify the correct pairing of o=
pening and closing delimiters in a given input string." loading=3D"lazy" wi=
