ression/image-07-01-6-QKVFAV54.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></f=
igure>
<hr>
<p>The next character is an opening parenthesis, which we just push to the =
top of the stack:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: left;"=
><img alt=3D"Image represents a visual explanation of a stack data structur=
e and its 'push' operation.  The left side shows a sequence of opening and =
